// ===========================================================================
// drc.template.runset — token template used by harness/pvrun.py
// ===========================================================================
// pvrun.py reads calibre/sg13g2_beol.drc, rewrites the LAYOUT PATH and
// LAYOUT PRIMARY statements below (Calibre expands $VAR in INCLUDE/LAYOUT
// PATH but NOT in LAYOUT PRIMARY — AGENTS.md §4 trap), and pushes the
// instantiated deck to the VM as <rundir>/<deck>.drc.
//
// Tokens (substituted by pvrun.py, never by Calibre):
//   @DECK@     absolute VM path of the instantiated rule deck
//   @GDS@      GDS file name in the run directory (no $ expansion by us:
//              plain relative name; calibre runs with cwd = run dir)
//   @PRIMARY@  top cell name
//   @RDB@      DRC results database file name
//   @SUMMARY@  DRC summary report file name

INCLUDE "@DECK@"

LAYOUT SYSTEM     GDSII
LAYOUT PATH       "@GDS@"
LAYOUT PRIMARY    "@PRIMARY@"
LAYOUT CASE       YES

DRC RESULTS DATABASE "@RDB@" ASCII
DRC SUMMARY REPORT   "@SUMMARY@"
